NAME
    gcloud container workload profiles - quickstart engine for GKE workload
        optimization

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud container workload profiles GROUP [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Quickstart engine for GKE workload optimization.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

GROUPS
    GROUP is one of the following:

     manifests
        Generate optimized Kubernetes manifests.
